    {
      "source": "Updates a <a href=\"../query/Query.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.elasticsearch.core.query\"><code>Query</code></a> by renaming the property names in the query to the correct mapped field names and the\nvalues to the converted values if the <a href=\"../mapping/ElasticsearchPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.elasticsearch.core.mapping\"><code>ElasticsearchPersistentProperty</code></a> for a property has a\n<a href=\"../mapping/PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.elasticsearch.core.mapping\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a>.",
      "translation": "根据 <a href=\"../mapping/ElasticsearchPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.elasticsearch.core.mapping\"><code>ElasticsearchPersistentProperty</code></a> 接口，如果某个属性的 <a href=\"../mapping/PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.elasticsearch.core.mapping\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a> 存在，则通过重命名查询中的属性名称为正确的映射字段名，并将值转换为转换后的值来更新 <a href=\"../query/Query.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.elasticsearch.core.query\"><code>Query</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Updates a <a href=\"../query/Query.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.elasticsearch.core.query\"><code>Query</code></a> by renaming the property names in the query to the correct mapped field names and the\nvalues to the converted values if the <a href=\"../mapping/ElasticsearchPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.elasticsearch.core.mapping\"><code>ElasticsearchPersistentProperty</code></a> for a property has a\n<a href=\"../mapping/PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.elasticsearch.core.mapping\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a>. If domainClass is null it's a noop.",
      "translation": "根据 <a href=\"../mapping/ElasticsearchPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.elasticsearch.core.mapping\"><code>ElasticsearchPersistentProperty</code></a> 是否为某个属性配置了 <a href=\"../mapping/PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.elasticsearch.core.mapping\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a>，该方法会更新 <a href=\"../query/Query.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.elasticsearch.core.query\"><code>Query</code></a>：将查询中的属性名称重映射为正确的字段名，并将值转换为对应的转换后值。如果 domainClass 为 null，则此操作无效。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/CustomConversions.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>CustomConversions</code></a> to be applied during the mapping process. <br/>\nConversions are registered after <a href=\"#afterPropertiesSet()\"><code>bean initialization</code></a>.",
      "translation": "将<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/CustomConversions.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>CustomConversions</code></a>设置为在映射过程中应用。<br/>\n转换将在<a href=\"#afterPropertiesSet()\"><code>bean 初始化</code></a>之后注册。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Elasticsearch specific <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/EntityConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>EntityConverter</code></a> implementation based on domain type\n<a href=\"../mapping/ElasticsearchPersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.elasticsearch.core.mapping\"><code>metadata</code></a>.",
